WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.610
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.790
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.390
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.930
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.930
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.340
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.900
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:35.510
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.210
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.980
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.650
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:49.360
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.620
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:56.000
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.760
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.910
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:06.840
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.650
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.880
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:16.180
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:22.710
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.460
Good morning, little birds!

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.160
Yo, Rurippe!

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:01.160
What are you doing there, Ukiya?!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.240
The school dorm was all booked up.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:08.540
So the commander kindly
found me these lodgings.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.210
Wh...?

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.880
Ukiya, you shameless cad!
You dirty-minded lowlife!

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:18.220
Cut it out, Rurippe!

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.550
Pervertl!

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:30.830
Argh! I had a spotless
attendance record until now!

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:34.430
If l'm late, it's your fault!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.570
Like I said, why is it my fault?!

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.440
Barely made it!

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.710
You were lucky, Rurip...

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:49.980
- Good morning, lkusawa.
- lkusawa, good morning!

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:51.710
Good morning, everyone!

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:55.890
Good morning, Ukiya.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.660
You'll be late if you
keep standing there.

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.560
You're acting like a
faker again, Rurippe.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.430
Excuse me?!

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:08.930
Uh... er...

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.410
C- Class is going to start. Let's go.

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:31.920
<i>Soap suds, soap suds!
Let 's wash our hands!</i>

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.990
Not again. Give me a break!

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.970
Really. We're in high school now.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:43.270
I like Tategami High, butl can't
stand this stupid hand-washing song!

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:43.930
Tell me about it!

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:51.980
Inside AND out?

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.980
- Stop dragging your feet!
- Ow, ow, ow!

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.820
That's the emergency call signal!

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:00.220
What?! THAT?

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.160
WASTE BIN

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.700
H- Hey!

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.510
I'm here, Commander.

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:38.090
The chutes seem
to be misadjusted.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.990
- Ms. Ochiai, revise that later.
- Yes, sir.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.400
Ow...

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:45.030
Now, without further ado,
please look at this.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.070
This is the list of Gate Keeper
candidates, right, sir?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:55.810
Reiko Asagiri, age 18. She is a
Grade 12 student at Sayuri Academy.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:58.750
Wow, the see-through look!

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.610
For the past several years
she has been playing piano...

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.150
...as a volunteer at children's
hospitals and kindergartens.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.850
She has become renowned as
"The Bewitching Melody."

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:17.530
Those who listen to her play are
said to experience wonderful dreams.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.430
Bewitching melody?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.410
Do you believe this is
attributed to gate-ability, sir?

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:27.710
We're not certain of that yet.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:30.640
However, according to the report
from AEGIS intelligence...

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:34.840
...para-freqs were registered in the
vicinity of her house late last night.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:36.510
Invaders!

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:39.350
That is where you two
come in. Begin the guard...

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:43.590
...of Miss Asagiri immediately.
At the same time...

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:48.090
...we are to investigate to see
whether she's a gate keeper or not!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.330
That is correct, Miss lkusawa.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:53.830
Roger, AEGIS!

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:57.470
I would be delighted to guard
such a beautiful woman!

00:05:57.610 --> 00:05:59.240
Just a moment!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.100
I have something to give you.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.680
Something to give me?

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:08.110
His Earth Defense License,
Commander?

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.920
Earth Defense... what?

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:17.210
This license permits the holder
to take any action beyond the law.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.930
The all-purpose
Earth Defense License.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.970
Wow.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.240
What's this?

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:33.440
That is a specially-made
wooden sword containing...

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:38.310
...a miniature energy amplifier
which reacts to your gate-ability.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.750
This is amazing!

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.050
And one other thing.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.220
Is this what you wanted to show me?

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.530
Yes. This is it.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.930
U.P. one-five?

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:14.580
This is the Gate Keeper team's
special pursuit vehicie...

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.140
...the UP-15, also known as...

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:18.810
...the Yotahachi!

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.220
Allow me to introduce
you. This is...

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.820
...chief mechanic of the
Far Eastern Branch of AEGIS...

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.630
Call me Megane.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:33.600
Your "Gate of Wind” power can make
an ordinary van exceed 300 km/hour.

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:36.660
This vehicle is specially
designed to work with that power.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:40.000
I consider it the AEGIS Far Eastern
branch's greatest masterpiece!

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:43.210
Not another sand storm!!

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:45.110
We get a lot of them at this school!

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:02.530
Eek!

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.290
Ooh, intense!

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:19.610
Are you okay driving, Ukiya?
Maybe you should go a little slower.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.150
I'm fine!

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.310
Damn,
This thing is tuned really well!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.960
I guess it does run in the family.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:39.330
Your dad loved cars, too.

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.060
Don't talk about him.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.140
U.. Ukiya?!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.340
Now you're definitely
going too fastl! Come on!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.680
Have you any idea how far
you exceeded the speed limit?!

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:02.190
You look like you're in high school.
Where'd you get a car like this?!

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:06.320
Don't try to laugh your way out!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:09.760
You'd better have a license.
Well, show it to me!

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:11.900
Here.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:16.060
What is this? Earth Defe...

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.960
G- Good God!

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:24.150
E- Excuse my rude behavior, sir!
Good work on your special tasks!

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:26.480
Thank you!

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.360
So that's the legendary
Earth Defense License...!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:40.550
I never seen one before.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:45.930
She is a busy young lady.
Please keep your business short.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:48.340
<i>Yes, ma'am.</i>

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:54.400
So tell us, Reiko, has anything of an
unusual nature ever occurred around you?

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.340
Hm... Hm...

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:03.580
Oh! Now that you mention it,
I got 5O points on my biology test!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.520
What?

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:09.720
I've never gotten more
than 37 points until now...

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.690
...so that was really unusual!

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:17.620
All right, so what do you think
of things unexplained by science...

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:21.000
...such as super powers
and flying saucers?

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.140
Well, I would love to
try out a flying broomstick!

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.180
Fairy Tales
Little Red Riding Hood

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:33.740
Th- The way you play the piano is
referred to as "The Bewitching Melody."

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.050
Do you play it In any Unique way?

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:39.680
Um... Um...

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.090
Excuse me, but...

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.790
Yes?

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:47.190
What does "bewitching" mean?

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:51.970
Ukiya, you ask her something, too.

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.730
Okay.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:57.930
Miss Reiko, why aren't you dressed
in see-through clothing today?

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:01.770
Oh, wow!
It's a picture from the fashion show...

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.870
...Mama forced me to be in.

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:10.310
Miss Reiko!
It is time for your lesson!

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:16.690
Honestly! We got thrown out
thanks to your stupid question.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.230
You told me to ask something.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.460
What a pretty song.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:37.740
Yeah, but the melody
sounds sort of lonely.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.300
The Bewitching...

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.840
...Melody.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.450
TOWN HALL

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:19.440
Reiko Asagiri Charity Piano Concert
Hey, you! I told you to line up in twos!!

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:24.960
YOU! You have three there!
Can't you even count? Huh?!

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:30.790
I'm amazed at how many idiots
this amateur concert is pulling in!

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:34.900
No kidding. Unlike us, some idiots
have too much time on their hands.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:38.100
B- But isn't food and drink
prohibited inside the concert hail?

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:42.570
Humph. It's impossible to last
through a boring piano concert...

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.610
...without something to eat.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.610
All right, I'll take one bag.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.850
Here you are. That's 200 yen.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.890
What?!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.750
That's more expensive than ramen!

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:56.750
Get your expensive,
badly-made pamphlets here!

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:59.590
Excuse me, but where is seat L-1O?

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.290
You know, the numbers are
on the backs of the seats...

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:02.920
...so why don't you go
look for it yourself?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.470
Okay...

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:14.870
RESERVED

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.610
<i>Wow...</i>

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:28.890
<i>It's so pretty</i>

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.190
<i>ls this my piano?</i>

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.860
<i>Thank you, Papa, Mama.</i>

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:41.790
<i>Papa? Mama?</i>

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.370
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:49.580
<i>Papa? Mama?!</i>

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.050
Miss.

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:54.420
Ms. Ono.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:59.210
Well, are you ready?
It's almost time for the concert.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.050
Um...

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:06.720
...but must I really
perform today's concert?

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:12.890
Miss, this kind of a formal
concert doesn't happen that often.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:15.660
All these people are
gathered to hear you play.

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:19.600
You haven't been able to perform
in such a large hall before.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:28.150
Come now. Everyone is looking
forward to hearing you play.

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:30.810
Looking forvvard...?

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:36.520
It's about to start.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:25.400
Wh- What is this piano music?!

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:35.010
Th- The piano...

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.550
Miss Reiko!!

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.790
I'm counting on you,
Ukiya! I'll get Reiko!

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:18.330
Okay!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:24.330
GATE OPEN!

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.730
Huh?

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:28.790
Uh-oh.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:32.170
Maybe it's this way!
Gate! Gate? Hello, Gate?!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.620
Oh, dear.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:42.340
What are you doing?!
Concentrate harder!

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:45.550
I know!

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:51.260
GATE...

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:56.560
Geez!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.570
This is the power of
my special wooden sword.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.740
Uh-oh...

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.760
That explains it!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:39.910
Ukiya!

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.210
Their ears! Aim for their ears!

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:53.350
The power of the Bewitching
Melody interferes with them!

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:57.780
Now that's figured out,
let's get to it!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:10.470
Commencing fusion.

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.420
Wh- What?!

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.860
"A- Argh!”

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:42.590
"U-Ugh!"

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:43.850
H Huh?"

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:44.810
"Oh!"

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:46.650
" Reiko?!"

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:52.370
(gasp- gasp- gasp)

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.940
"Hey!
The power of illusion disappearedl!"

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.570
"The piano is being drowned out
by their electric guitar."

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:11.850
"lf we don't do something,
it will erase Reiko, then us!"

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.100
(scream)

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:21.900
<i>"Looks like its time for me to step in. "</i>

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:26.340
H Megane?!"

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.600
"just leave this sort of thing to me!"

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.830
"Switch On! Yeah!!"

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.920
All right! Now we can fight!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.780
Way to go, Megane!

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:56.720
<i>Thanks, Mr. Ukiya!</i>

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:05.520
I'm sick of hearing
your electric guitar!!!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:24.620
<i>Thank you, Papa! Mama!</i>

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:38.230
A gate!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:21:10.690
Reiko!

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:14.370
- Are you okay?
- Hold on, miss!

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:16.870
Miss Reiko...

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.140
Miss Reiko, hang on! Miss R...

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:27.580
Ukiya. Ruriko...

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:30.310
Boy, that was fun!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:32.280
Pardon?

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:37.820
I just used magic, didn't I!

00:21:38.930 --> 00:21:41.230
Ma... gic?

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:45.700
I always wanted to be a witch,
ever since I was a child.

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:48.960
A witch, huh?

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:11.300
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:15.160
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:20.140
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:23.510
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:25.640
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:30.820
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:34.150
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:34.150 --> 00:22:38.780
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:43.660
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:48.290
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.770 --> 00:22:55.070
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
